            "source_entity_type": "Instrument",
            "relation": "MEASURES_VARIABLE",
            "target_entity_instance": "sea surface temperature",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Data assembly. NOAA OI \u00bc Degree Daily SST Analysis data were acquired from NOAA's National Climatic Data Center at http://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/oa/climate/research/sst/oi-daily.php. AVHRR-only data were used because it is the only daily SST analysis that extends back to 1981/1982 (ref. 54).",
