            "paragraph": "NOAA's OI algorithm adjusts the satellite data relative to 15 days55 of quality-controlled in situ ship and buoy data from ICOADS56, to achieve long-term stability. There is no evidence for yearly or decadal scale difference in OI SST relative to in situ observations over the period 1985 to 2005 (Fig. 1 in Reynolds et al.9).",
