            "paragraph": "The Northeast Somali coast has been showing a tendency for colder SSTs during June-August (approximately -0.5\u00b0C per decade, area 4, Fig. 8a). This coincides with the timing of the Summer Monsoon, when Ekman transport brings upwelled, cooler waters along the coast23.",
