            "paragraph": "When compared with estimates for the global ocean, our study yields higher decadal rates of SST change at the coast. For example, a recent analysis for the period 1960-2009 using HadISST1.1 data reported an oceanic SST rate of change of 0.07 \u00b0C per decade and an average change in seasonal timing of - 2.3 days per decade8.",
